<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head">
    <view class="page-title">等级说明</view>
    <view class="page-sub">从识形到通源，六级汉字能力自测 · 共 {{total}} 字</view>
  </view>

  <view class="body-wrap">
    <scroll-view
    scroll-y
    enhanced="{{true}}"
    show-scrollbar="{{false}}"
    class="page-body"
    scroll-into-view="{{intoView}}"
    bindscroll="onScroll"
  >
    <view class="container">
      <view class="card">
        <view class="muted level-note">甲/乙/丙/丁/戊/己 为传统分级用字，甲最高。</view>
        <view class="level-item" wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="n">
          <view class="level-no">
            <text class="lv-mark lv{{item.n}}">{{item.mark}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="level-body">
            <view class="level-head">{{item.name}}</view>
            <view class="level-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="card" id="rank-card">
        <view class="section-title">科举功名</view>
        <view class="muted">字库页的「掌握度」以科举功名表示：</view>
        <view class="rank-row" wx:for="{{ranks}}" wx:key="name">
          <view class="rank-name"><text class="lv-rank sm">{{item.name}}</text></view>
          <view class="rank-range">{{item.range}}</view>
          <view class="rank-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="rule">测字不足 18 个时，不论成绩一律为「白丁」。</view>
        <view class="rule">掌握度 = 已测字平均等级 × 字库覆盖率的平方根。</view>
        <view class="muted mt">取自科举晋升序列：童生 → 秀才 → 举人 → 贡士 → 进士 → 状元（另加「蒙童」启蒙档）。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="card">
        <view class="section-title">字库档位</view>
        <view
          class="scope-row"
          wx:for="{{scopes}}"
          wx:key="index"
          data-index="{{item.index}}"
          bindtap="openScope"
        >
          <view class="scope-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="scope-count">{{item.count}} 字 ›</view>
        </view>
        <view class="muted mt">全部字库共 {{total}} 字，按启蒙、小学、初中、高中逐级累进。</view>
        <view class="muted mt">档位字数为累计值，选择后只包含该档新增的字。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="card">
        <view class="section-title">计分方式</view>
        <view class="rule">单字测级从甲开始逐级出题，答错即停在上一级。</view>
        <view class="rule">整体自测按档位抽字，每个字独立测级。</view>
        <view class="rule">平均等级越高、掌握度越高，说明识字水平越好。</view>
        <view class="rule">某个等级数据缺失时会自动跳过，不记为答错。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
    <view class="scrollbar {{showBar ? 'show' : ''}}">
      <view class="scrollbar-thumb" style="top: {{barTop}}%; height: {{barHeight}}%"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="page-footer">
    <view class="btn ghost" bindtap="goHome">回首页</view>
  </view>
</view>
